From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 01:56:46 +0000
Subject: Update tzdata to 2026e

Brings ICU's time zone data up to tzdata 2026e by backporting upstream
ICU's time zone updates through 19dfb44a6 ("Update tzdata to 2026e"):
6ebb40c5 ("Update tzdata to 2026c and rebuild data files."), 5aa52620
("Update TZDB to 2024d", which is 2026d despite its subject) and
19dfb44a6. Zones whose offsets change include America/Vancouver
(permanent UTC-7 from 2026-11-01), America/Edmonton, America/Inuvik,
Africa/Casablanca and Africa/El_Aaiun.

2026e also maps Europe/London and Europe/Dublin to the GMT metazone.
Without it they map only to the British and Irish metazones, which have
no English winter name, so after daylight saving time ends ICU formats
their long time zone name as "GMT+00:00" instead of
"Greenwich Mean Time".

Chromium picks up time zone updates by rolling ICU in its DEPS, which this
Chromium branch has not done. Upstream's common/icudtl.dat also carries
unrelated data changes, so rather than copying it whole, this patch replaces
only its time zone items (metaZones.res, timezoneTypes.res and
zoneinfo64.res) with upstream's at 19dfb44a6, keeping every other item and
the existing layout. Making the same replacement in upstream 8cc91d9b6, the
parent of the first tzdata roll, reproduces upstream 19dfb44a6's
common/icudtl.dat byte for byte.

The source/data/misc text files and the README.chromium tzdata version are
upstream's at 19dfb44a6. Only common/icudtl.dat is rebuilt since it is the
only ICU data file Electron uses.

This patch can be removed once Chromium's DEPS ICU revision includes
19dfb44a6.

diff --git a/README.chromium b/README.chromium
index ac256fc7519781a50d040e0b0ec6a1c79438b549..b8c80b17f45fb361857e10aa6819c1e74b13a486 100644
--- a/README.chromium
+++ b/README.chromium
@@ -208,9 +208,9 @@ D. Local Modifications
     bug: https://crbug.com/381620359
     (scripts/update_tz.sh offers to perform this patch automatically)
 
-  As of Feb 25, 2026, the latest version is 2025c
+  As of Oct 6, 2026, the latest version is 2026e
   and the above files are available at the ICU github repos.
-  Compare: https://lists.iana.org/hyperkitty/list/tz-announce@iana.org/thread/TAGXKYLMAQRZRFTERQ33CEKOW7KRJVAK/
+  Compare: https://lists.iana.org/hyperkitty/list/tz-announce@iana.org/thread/L4IGHJRBUQR53F7RTEHM5IS7ZMBR3YXP/
 
 4. Build-related changes
 
diff --git a/common/icudtl.dat b/common/icudtl.dat
index 783aedc0b085bf7c8b15e0632ed8ee0f1f63303f..d30acebb833038180765f4b969b9e13baf202eb3 100644
